Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 21:49:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 40/61] Balance: Leech Life at low levels

Leech Life is 80 power now: a Rocket Grunt's Lv. 20 Zubat use Absorb
instead of their FireRed custom Leech Life, and (as in Gen 9) it's no
longer a Bellsprout/Yanma egg move. Level-up learnsets already follow
modern games (Absorb early, Leech Life later).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
